            },
            {
               "text": "<p><h3>Prerequisites</h3>In this game, we read the numbers recorded on the quipu and represent them on the Yupana. For more details, we recommend starting with:</p><p><ul><li><b>Drawing to count</b>: shows how we moved from using our fingers to drawing geometric shapes (<htcite0>).</li><li><b>Change of direction (Part I)</b>: presents the Indigenous idea of growing numbers upward (<htcite1>).</li><li><b>Change of direction (Part II)</b>: shows how large numbers are built order by order in the Yupana (<htcite2>).</li></ul></p>",
               "source": [
                  {
                     "type": 1,
                     "uuid": "9618a83e-f232-49db-84f6-fc3455a3f1d1",
                     "text": "History Tracers Team",
                     "page": "Drawing to count",
                     "date_time": {
