      {
         "id": "SECTION_game",
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "<p><h3>Read and set the number</h3>The highlighted cord is the number you must set. Use the bottom row of the Yupana for the units, the next row for the tens and the row above it for the hundreds. Click a square to add a mark; click it again to remove it. A row with no marks means zero. When the number on the Yupana matches the number on the cord, the game marks the cord as done and moves to the next one. Complete every cord of the level to win.</p>",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<p style=\"display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><span id=\"qyLevelBadge\" class=\"level-badge\">Level 1</span> <button type=\"button\" id=\"qyNewBtn\" class=\"reset-tutor-btn\">🎲 New number</button> <button type=\"button\" id=\"qyNextLevelBtn\" class=\"reset-tutor-btn\" style=\"background: #7e5a41;\">⭐ Next level</button></p><div class=\"quipuYupanaLayout\"><div id=\"qyBoard\" class=\"quipuBoard\"></div><div class=\"quipuYupanaBoard\"><table id=\"yupana1\" class=\"tawapukllay yupanaSmall\"><tr><th colspan=\"4\"><i>Yupana</i></th></tr> <tr id=\"tf1\"><td id=\"tc1f1\"><span class=\"dot five_dot_c1_up\"></span><span class=\"dot five_dot_c1_center\"></span><span class=\"dot five_dot_c1_bottom\"></span><span class=\"dot five_dot_c2_up\"></span><span class=\"dot five_dot_c2_bottom\"></span></td> <td id=\"tc2f1\"><span class=\"dot three_dot_bottom\"></span><span class=\"dot three_dot_up\"></span><span class=\"dot three_dot_center\"></span></td> <td id=\"tc3f1\"><span class=\"dot two_dot_bottom\"></span> <span class=\"dot two_dot_up\"></span></td> <td id=\"tc4f1\"><span class=\"dot dot_center\"></span></td></tr> <tr id=\"tf2\"><td id=\"tc1f2\"><span class=\"dot five_dot_c1_up\"></span><span class=\"dot five_dot_c1_center\"></span><span class=\"dot five_dot_c1_bottom\"></span><span class=\"dot five_dot_c2_up\"></span><span class=\"dot five_dot_c2_bottom\"></span></td> <td id=\"tc2f2\"><span class=\"dot three_dot_bottom\"></span><span class=\"dot three_dot_up\"></span><span class=\"dot three_dot_center\"></span></td> <td id=\"tc3f2\"><span class=\"dot two_dot_bottom\"></span> <span class=\"dot two_dot_up\"></span></td> <td id=\"tc4f2\"><span class=\"dot dot_center\"></span></td></tr> <tr id=\"tf3\"><td id=\"tc1f3\"><span class=\"dot five_dot_c1_up\"></span><span class=\"dot five_dot_c1_center\"></span><span class=\"dot five_dot_c1_bottom\"></span><span class=\"dot five_dot_c2_up\"></span><span class=\"dot five_dot_c2_bottom\"></span></td> <td id=\"tc2f3\"><span class=\"dot three_dot_bottom\"></span><span class=\"dot three_dot_up\"></span><span class=\"dot three_dot_center\"></span></td> <td id=\"tc3f3\"><span class=\"dot two_dot_bottom\"></span> <span class=\"dot two_dot_up\"></span></td> <td id=\"tc4f3\"><span class=\"dot dot_center\"></span></td></tr> <tr id=\"tf4\"><td id=\"tc1f4\"><span class=\"dot five_dot_c1_up\"></span><span class=\"dot five_dot_c1_center\"></span><span class=\"dot five_dot_c1_bottom\"></span><span class=\"dot five_dot_c2_up\"></span><span class=\"dot five_dot_c2_bottom\"></span></td> <td id=\"tc2f4\"><span class=\"dot three_dot_bottom\"></span><span class=\"dot three_dot_up\"></span><span class=\"dot three_dot_center\"></span></td> <td id=\"tc3f4\"><span class=\"dot two_dot_bottom\"></span> <span class=\"dot two_dot_up\"></span></td> <td id=\"tc4f4\"><span class=\"dot dot_center\"></span></td></tr></table></div></div><p id=\"qyMessage\" class=\"quipuMessage\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><p id=\"qyCongrats\" class=\"quipuCongrats\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\" style=\"display: none;\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-medal\" style=\"color: gold;\"></i> <span id=\"qyCongratsText\"></span></p><span id=\"qyLevelLabel\" style=\"display: none;\">Level</span><span id=\"qyOrder0\" style=\"display: none;\">Units</span><span id=\"qyOrder1\" style=\"display: none;\">Tens</span><span id=\"qyOrder2\" style=\"display: none;\">Hundreds</span><span id=\"qyMsgStart\" style=\"display: none;\">Read the highlighted cord and set its number on the Yupana.</span><span id=\"qyMsgReading\" style=\"display: none;\">Keep going: set the number shown on the highlighted cord.</span><span id=\"qyMsgString\" style=\"display: none;\">✅ Correct! Now read the next cord.</span><span id=\"qyMsgLevel\" style=\"display: none;\">🎉 Level complete! Click <b>Next level</b> to continue or <b>New number</b> to redo this level.</span><span id=\"qyMsgAllLevels\" style=\"display: none;\">🎉🏆 ALL LEVELS COMPLETE! 🏆🎉 You read every quipu! Click <b>Next level</b> to start again at level 1 or <b>New number</b> to redo this level.</span><span id=\"qyMsgOverflow\" style=\"display: none;\">⚠️ Overflow! The {place} row cannot hold more than 9. Remove some marks and try again.</span>",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<p class=\"desc\">The way the knots record numbers follows the description of the quipu (<htcite0>), and the use of the Yupana follows the practices presented in the previous texts (<htcite1> ; <htcite2> ; <htcite3>).</p>",
